documentation
learning
	^ 'Spaced repetition (SRS):
- SRSUser: singleton current (reset clears it). Holds knowledge Dictionary, goals Dictionary, current goal and an Announcer. xiaoWangZi installs the #xiaoWangZi goal and activates it; installGoal: calls levelup; knowledgeFor: creates SRSKnownContent on demand; exercise answers SRSExercise goal: goal; initializeAnnouncer subscribes SRSLevelUp to levelup; levelup unlocks the first 30 locked characters and unlocks words when every unlocked content has overAllLevel at least 8.
- SRSGoal: words (trie nodes) and characters (all characters of the words), session. xiaoWangZi: builds a goal from the HSKDictionaryLoader xiaoWangZi stream. words: orders by repetitions and appearance; charactersFor: selects the contents that haveToReview: a skill; unlockedWords, unlockedCharacters, lockedCharacters, unlockedContent, pinyinAttack; orderByRepetitionAndAparition: scores each item as repetitions * 2 + (size - index) divided by 30 rounded up, groups and sums; unlockWords unlocks words whose characters are all unlocked.
- SRSKnownContent: reification of memorized content. knowledge is the HSKCharacter or HSKString, skills is a Dictionary, lastReviewDate, locked (true initially), session. unlock, isUnlocked, isLocked; skill tags writing, reading, listenting (typo in the code), speaking, producing and phonetic; skill: defaults to SRSKnowledgeLevel zero; overAllLevel is the minimum skill level (zero if empty); nextReviewDate is the earliest next review (now if empty); hasToReview: and hasToReview:at: require unlocked and compare elapsed time with the skill schedule; submitReview:on: delegates to submitReview:at:on:withAnnouncer: (announcer from the session), increases on success, decreases on failure, announces SRSLevelIncreased or SRSLevelDecreased and SRSLevelUp when a new maximum is reached; giveUp: submits false.
- SRSKnowledgeLevel: level (1 to 12), max, levelupTimes, leveldownTimes. rateTable: 0s, 25s, 2m, 10m, 1h, 5h, 1d, 5d, 25d, 120d, 730d, 1000d; rateTexts: B, then empty, M, A, A+; rateValues: cubes 1..12. increase adds 1 capped at 12 and answers true on a new maximum; decrease subtracts 2 with minimum 1; hasToReview: compares rateTable at level with a Duration; nextReviewDateAfter:; isMaximal; min:; printOn: writes Lvl(n).
- SRSExercise: goal, shuffled stream of charactersFor: skill, current. done is the consumed prefix without current; todo is the rest; next and skill are subclassResponsibility; hasNext; current lazily calls next.
- SRSPhoneticExercise: skill is #phonetic; next creates HSKPhoneticTest subject: stream next.
- SRSAnnoucement and subclasses SRSLevelUp, SRSLevelIncreased, SRSLevelDecreased carry oldLevel, oldDate, levelObject and currentDate.
- HSKPhoneticTest: subject is an SRSKnownContent; word and meanings come from subject knowledge asHSKString; hint lists characters with the same pinyin; assertWith: compares the entry with pinyin includes (strict) or, in friendly mode, with digits removed, then submitReview:on: #phonetic; beFriendly; friendlyAssert:; giveUp; level.'